# AGENTS.md

## Project context

- Preferred Codex environment: {{AGENT_LABEL}}.
- Keep one repository inside one operating-system toolchain; do not share `node_modules` or virtual environments across Windows and WSL.
- Never read, print, or commit API keys, access tokens, SSH private keys, browser credentials, or `.env` values.

## Working agreements

- Inspect the repository and explain any risky or destructive action before running it.
- Preserve unrelated user changes and keep edits narrowly scoped.
- Use the project's declared package manager and lockfile.
- Run the smallest relevant formatter, lint, type-check, and test commands before completion.
- Ask before adding production dependencies or changing public interfaces.

## Verification

- Report commands run, results, remaining risks, and any manual follow-up.
- Do not claim success when required checks were skipped or failed.
